   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div><span style=\"color:rgb(41,47,51);line-height:32px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">All,</font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(41,47,51);font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small;line-height:32px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(41,47,51);font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small;line-height:32px;white-space:pre-wrap\">I can&#39;t access Java static fields from Renjin using &quot;Class$Field&quot; (e.g: &quot;Integer$MAX_VALUE&quot;), should it work?</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">Regards,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace;font-size:small\">-- </span></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\">Fernando Ribeiro</font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1WS6pu8wZjsJ",
   "from": "Bertram, Alexander",
   "author": "f06db63329fab1f9",
   "date": "2014-08-25T08:02:26Z",
   "subject": "Re: Accessing Java Static Fields",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You should be to call static methods in this way, but you&#39;ll need to get a reference to the class first using its fully qualified name, for example:<div><br></div><div>Integer &lt;- import(java.lang.Integer)</div>\r\n\r\n<div>Integer$MAX_VALUE</div><div><br></div><div>If this doesn&#39;t work then there might be something wrong...</div><div><br></div><div>HTH,</div><div>Alex</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n\r\nOn Sun, Aug 24, 2014 at 11:06 PM, Fernando Ribeiro <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">fernando...@upic.com.br</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
